Tomas Heran <tomas.heran@oracle.com> (original Solaris stream extension)
Solaris stream transport and RAD source/binary compatibility, adapted to 1.0.10.

RAD owns its transports (including TLS) and calls MHD_run() from one thread.
Retain the installed stream flag value and three-argument unescape ABI.
Reserve a different bit for upstream AUTO and keep the legacy int callbacks.
Keep upstream response lifetime and notification handling unchanged.
Retain RAD keepalive for initial-callback bodyless GET/HEAD/DELETE replies.
Unread bodies and chunked requests retain upstream early-close handling.
This Solaris extension has not been shared with upstream.

